# Feedback tokens: the report API's credentials (docs/reports.md).
rt-title = Feedback tokens
rt-lead = With a token, a script, a build machine or an agent uses the report API without an account. Give each its own token with only the rights it needs. A report's history names the token behind every change.
rt-none = No token yet.
rt-new = New token
rt-name-hint = Who or what uses it, such as “Nightly build”.
