rt-preset-post = Only post
rt-preset-read = Only read
rt-preset-edit = Read and edit
rt-preset-all = Everything
rt-rights = Its rights
rt-rights-hint = Editing includes reading, and deleting for good includes editing.
rt-right-file = File reports
rt-right-read = Read reports and download their parts
rt-right-triage = Edit: status, labels, assignee, notes, trash
rt-right-purge = Delete reports for good
rt-by = Created by
rt-expires = Expires
rt-used = Last used
rt-never = Never
rt-live = Active
rt-expired = Expired
rt-suspended = Paused
rt-suspended-text = Its maker is not an administrator any more, so it does nothing.
rt-revoked-at = Revoked { $time }
rt-revoked-by = Revoked { $time } by { $name }
rt-revoke-title = Revoke the token “{ $name }”?
rt-revoke-text = It stops working at once and cannot be brought back. What it filed and changed stays.
rt-revoked-done = The feedback token is revoked.
rt-missing = This token no longer exists.
rt-shown-lead = Send it with every request as “Authorization: Bearer” followed by this text. Baylee Central keeps only its digest: once you leave this page, nobody can show it again.
rt-full = Baylee Central made no token. Either 32 tokens are active, or 32 were made in the last day. Revoke one, or try again later.
